But then the question is asking how many miles she can drive on a single tank. The tank holds 12 gallons. So if she can get 25 miles per gallon, then multiplying that by the tank capacity would give the total miles. So 25 times 12. Let me calculate that. 25 times 12 is 300. So that would be 300 miles.

